{"step": 4, "tool": "write_file", "args": {"path": "love_letter.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>For My Love</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe6e6 0%, #fff0f5 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n            padding: 40px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(255, 182, 193, 0.5);\n            max-width: 600px;\n            text-align: center;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            color: #d63384;\n            font-size: 2.5em;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(255, 182, 193, 0.5);\n        }\n\n        .heart {\n            font-size: 4em;\n            color: #e91e63;\n            animation: heartbeat 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;\n            display: inline-block;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes heartbeat {\n            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }\n            50% { transform: scale(1.1); }\n        }\n\n        .message {\n            color: #666;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .signature {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #d63384;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .floating-hearts {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .heart-float {\n            position: absolute;\n            font-size: 2em;\n            color: rgba(233, 30, 99, 0.6);\n            animation: floatUp 8s linear infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes floatUp {\n            0% { transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(0deg); opacity: 0; }\n            10% { opacity: 1; }\n            90% { opacity: 1; }\n            100% { transform: translateY(-100vh) rotate(360deg); opacity: 0; }\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #e91e63, #f48fb1);\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        .btn:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(233, 30, 99, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .hidden-message {\n            display: none;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe6e6, #fff0f5);\n            border-radius: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .hidden-message.show {\n            display: block;\n            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fadeIn {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n\n        /* Envelope Styles */\n        .envelope-container {\n            position: relative;\n            width: 300px;\n            height: 200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: transform 0.5s ease;\n        }\n\n        .envelope-container:hover {\n            transform: scale(1.05);\n        }\n\n        .envelope {\n            position: relative;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: #e91e63;\n            border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;\n            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(233, 30, 99, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .envelope::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 0;\n            border-left: 150px solid transparent;\n            border-right: 150px solid transparent;\n            border-top: 120px solid #c2185b;\n        }\n\n        .envelope::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 0;\n            border-left: 150px solid transparent;\n            border-right: 150px solid transparent;\n            border-bottom: 120px solid #e91e63;\n        }\n\n        .envelope-flap {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(0deg);\n            width: 0;\n            height: 0;\n            border-left: 150px solid transparent;\n            border-right: 150px solid transparent;\n            border-top: 120px solid #f48fb1;\n            transition: transform 0.5s ease, z-index 0.3s ease;\n            z-index: 5;\n        }\n\n        .envelope-flap.open {\n            transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(-180deg);\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .letter {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translateX(-50%);\n            width: 260px;\n            height: 180px;\n            background: #fff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease, bottom 0.6s ease;\n            z-index: 2;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .letter.open {\n            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-180px) rotate(5deg);\n            bottom: -180px;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .letter-content {\n            font-size: 1em;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: #333;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n\n        .click-hint {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            color: #e91e63;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            animation: pulse 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse {\n            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; }\n            50% { opacity: 1; }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"floating-hearts\" id=\"hearts\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <!-- Envelope on start page -->\n        <div class=\"envelope-container\" id=\"envelopeContainer\">\n            <div class=\"envelope-flap\" id=\"flap\"></div>\n            <div class=\"letter\" id=\"letter\">\n                <div class=\"letter-content\">\n                    <h2 style=\"color: #e91e63; margin-bottom: 15px;\">My Dearest Love</h2>\n                    <p>Every moment with you feels like a beautiful dream I never want to wake from.</p>\n                    <br>\n                    <p>You are my sunshine on cloudy days, my laughter in quiet moments, and the reason my heart beats just a little faster.</p>\n                    <br>\n                    <p>Thank you for being exactly who you are. Thank you for loving me as much as I love you.</p>\n                    <br>\n                    <p>I promise to always cherish you, support you, and stand by your side through all of life's adventures.</p>\n                    <br>\n                    <p style=\"font-style: italic; color: #d63384;\">With all my love,<br>Your forever</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"click-hint\" id=\"clickHint\">❤️ Click to Open ❤️</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Hidden message that appears after opening -->\n        <div class=\"hidden-message\" id=\"hiddenMessage\">\n            <h1>My Dearest Love</h1>\n            <div class=\"message\">\n                Every moment with you feels like a beautiful dream I never want to wake from.<br><br>\n                You are my sunshine on cloudy days, my laughter in quiet moments, and the reason my heart beats just a little faster.<br><br>\n                Thank you for being exactly who you are. Thank you for loving me as much as I love you.<br><br>\n                I promise to always cherish you, support you, and stand by your side through all of life's adventures.<br><br>\n                With all my love,<br>Your forever\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Create floating hearts\n        const heartsContainer = document.getElementById('hearts');\n        for (let i = 0; i < 15; i++) {\n            const heart = document.createElement('div');\n            heart.className = 'heart-float';\n            heart.innerHTML = '❤️';\n            heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + '%';\n            heart.style.animationDelay = Math.random() * 8 + 's';\n            heartsContainer.appendChild(heart);\n        }\n\n        // Envelope interaction\n        const envelopeContainer = document.getElementById('envelopeContainer');\n        const flap = document.getElementById('flap');\n        const letter = document.getElementById('letter');\n        const clickHint = document.getElementById('clickHint');\n        const hiddenMessage = document.getElementById('hiddenMessage');\n\n        envelopeContainer.addEventListener('click', () => {\n            // Open the envelope\n            flap.classList.add('open');\n            letter.classList.add('open');\n            clickHint.style.display = 'none';\n            \n            // Show the hidden message after animation\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                hiddenMessage.classList.add('show');\n                envelopeContainer.style.opacity = '0';\n                envelopeContainer.style.pointerEvents = 'none';\n            }, 800);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>"}, "result": "wrote 9868 characters to love_letter.html", "latency": 52.78, "ts": "2026-10-15T16:19:20"}
